      {
        "kind": "enabling",
        "text": "**Dispose pattern**: IDisposable for resources",
        "mechanism": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "caution",
        "text": "**GC pauses**: Non-deterministic .NET GC",
        "mechanism": null
      },
      {
        "kind": "caution",
        "text": "**Disposal is explicit**: There is no `using` block for a resource, so a value is released with `try`/`finally`, or by the `clean` block that a PowerShell 7.3 function runs when it ends",
        "mechanism": null
